      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=60785ded115da6006f540529\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"60785ded115da6006f540529\" data-account-id=\"60785ded115da6006f540529\" accountid=\"60785ded115da6006f540529\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Andrew Woods</a> For this specific case, what steps are needed to get the exact generic 409? I tried reproducing the issue by making different REST calls but would like to narrow down to only the linking scenario mentioned in the github issue. I read the fcrepo documentation on 409s generated but this issue doesn't seem to be one of those documented cases.  Thanks.</p>",
