     "body": "<p>I am really not sure, <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3A5665ee66-7fc9-476a-ba31-3a9e2e39feee\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"557058:5665ee66-7fc9-476a-ba31-3a9e2e39feee\" data-account-id=\"557058:5665ee66-7fc9-476a-ba31-3a9e2e39feee\" accountid=\"557058:5665ee66-7fc9-476a-ba31-3a9e2e39feee\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Osman Din</a>. <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5fca89e97cc1030069d4e167\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"5fca89e97cc1030069d4e167\" data-account-id=\"5fca89e97cc1030069d4e167\" accountid=\"5fca89e97cc1030069d4e167\" rel=\"noreferrer\">justin</a> mentioned doing a PUT on a resource before it's parent was created (which seems pretty clear), but maybe he has more details.<br/>\nAre you not getting a 409 in that scenario?</p>",
