      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Sorry, but the wording above isn't clear to me. How do I do a PUT on a resource before the parent is created? I've always seen the cases where the parent always exists (or is created) before the child is created.</p>",
     "created": "24/Feb/15 11:53 AM",
     "id": "13544",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/11349/comment/13544",
