      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>That is a good point, <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3A5665ee66-7fc9-476a-ba31-3a9e2e39feee\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"557058:5665ee66-7fc9-476a-ba31-3a9e2e39feee\" data-account-id=\"557058:5665ee66-7fc9-476a-ba31-3a9e2e39feee\" accountid=\"557058:5665ee66-7fc9-476a-ba31-3a9e2e39feee\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Osman Din</a>. The following PUT works just fine:<br/>\n`curl -i -XPUT localhost:8080/rest/not-exist/new-resource`</p>\n\n<p>Unless <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5fca89e97cc1030069d4e167\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"5fca89e97cc1030069d4e167\" data-account-id=\"5fca89e97cc1030069d4e167\" accountid=\"5fca89e97cc1030069d4e167\" rel=\"noreferrer\">justin</a> has more details, we should close this ticket as \"Can not reproduce\".</p>",
